{
  "_comment": [
    "THE INCLUDE LIST for the kart page: what it loads, in order, and nothing else.",
    "KartProvider after RenderProvider (the battle drives RenderProvider's nodes by their verbs);",
    "NetworkProvider for the battle between runtimes (the record, the proposals, presence, the hall);",
    "ShellProvider last so the navigator comes up in the embedded terminal."
  ],
  "modules": [
    "WindowProvider.wasm",
    "RenderProvider.wasm",
    "KartProvider.wasm",
    "NetworkProvider.wasm",
    "ShellProvider.wasm"
  ],
  "_scripts": [
    "Staged into the browser's filesystem under these names before main() runs, each also",
    "answering over HTTP (kart_mounts.etcs). A script's name is its OS path. The hall's two",
    "scripts are chess's: the hall is the site's name server for every game, listed the same way."
  ],
  "scripts": [
    "boot_kart.etcs",
    "KartProvider/scripts/kart_arena.etcs",
    "KartProvider/scripts/kart_wall.etcs",
    "KartProvider/scripts/kart_block.etcs",
    "KartProvider/scripts/kart_blocks.etcs",
